<Item XName="CalculateACP" UserName="CalculateACP" Type="function">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>function ACP = CalculateACP(FCarrier, BW, Offset, Spec_CxVlotage, Spec_CxVlotage_Freq)&#x000D;&#x000A;% calcualte the Adjacent Channel Leakage Ratio&#x000D;&#x000A;% FCarrier: center frequency&#x000D;&#x000A;% BW: measuring bandwidth&#x000D;&#x000A;% Offset: the measured channel offset relative to the center frequency.&#x000D;&#x000A;% Spec_CxVlotage: spectrum power got from SpectrumAnalyzer&#x000D;&#x000A;% Spec_CxVlotage_Freq: frequency corresponding to the Spec_Power&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;ACP = 999;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;fre = FCarrier + Offset;&#x000D;&#x000A;acp_fstart = fre-BW/2;&#x000D;&#x000A;acp_fstop = fre+BW/2;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;%ACP&#x000D;&#x000A;indxes = find(Spec_CxVlotage_Freq &gt;= acp_fstart &amp; Spec_CxVlotage_Freq &lt;= acp_fstop);&#x000D;&#x000A;ACP = dbm(sum(abs(Spec_CxVlotage(indxes)).^2))-20;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;end</Text>
