<DataEntry>[0]</DataEntry>
<Description>used for PUCCH DMRS initialization (0~65535). Given by the higher-layer parameters scramblingID0.</Description>
<HideCondition>0==PUCCH_Enable || PUCCH_Format ~= 2</HideCondition>
